    {
      "title": "Sam Wood makes fresh bail bid over domestic violence charges as court hears of ‘party lifestyle’ and alleged anger issues",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/30/sam-wood-bail-bid-court-wife-szezana-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Former Bachelor star and wellness influencer stands accused of choking and assaulting wife at Noosa in Queensland</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>\n <br />\n <br />\n A Queensland court has heard claims that former Bachelor star Sam Wood used drugs and alcohol, engaged in a “party lifestyle” and that he “struggles with anger”, as Wood makes a second bid for bail on <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/05/sam-wood-charged-domestic-violence-ntwnfb\">domestic violence charges</a>\n <br />\n <br />\n Wood, 46, from Melbourne, has been held in custody since his arrest on 4 October at Noosa.\n</p><p>He was initially denied bail over allegations he choked and assaulted his wife, Snezana, while the family was holidaying on the Sunshine Coast.\n <br />\n <br />\n He is charged with two domestic violence offences: assault occasioning bodily harm and strangulation in a domestic setting.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/30/sam-wood-bail-bid-court-wife-szezana-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-30T02:47:58"
    },
    {
      "title": "Former Sydney childcare worker Ashley Paul Griffith hit with 202 more abuse charges",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/30/ashley-paul-griffith-queensland-paedophile-childcare-worker-additional-charges-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>NSW police say charges include child rape and relate to 23 alleged victims aged between one and five at a Sydney childcare centre</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>One of Australia’s most notorious paedophiles is facing hundreds more child abuse charges, including for the alleged rape of children as young as one.</p><p>Days after being extradited from Queensland to New South Wales, Ashley Paul Griffith was hit with 202 charges dating from between 2014 and 2017, with police labelling the allegations “deeply disturbing”.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/oct/30/ashley-paul-griffith-queensland-paedophile-childcare-worker-additional-charges-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-30T02:01:55"
    },
    {
      "title": "Antisemitism envoy proposes ‘external ombudsman’ to monitor ABC and SBS coverage of Israel and Middle East",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/oct/30/jillian-segal-antisemitism-envoy-plan-report-priorities-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Jillian Segal says perception of link between coverage of conflicts and hostility towards Jewish Australians ‘is itself a matter of public importance’</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>The federal government’s antisemitism envoy has proposed an “external independent ombudsman” to monitor ABC and SBS coverage of the war in Gaza, and a requirement that all visa applicants be screened for “the risk of holding antisemitic views”.</p><p>In an <a href=\"https://www.aseca.gov.au/sites/default/files/2026-10/combatting-antisemitism-special-envoys-priorities.pdf\">updated plan released on Friday</a>, Jillian Segal said Australia’s two public broadcasters should be subjected to greater oversight.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/media/2026/oct/30/jillian-segal-antisemitism-envoy-plan-report-priorities-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-30T00:37:36"
    }
